{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12244070","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12244070","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1224407001:1":{"text":"Sinbad, what are you doing here? We've been looking for you!","source_cn":"辛巴达，你怎么躲在这里？我们找了你好久！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x842FF176507F5C85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1224407002:1":{"text":"Why waste your time searching for me? You should be joining the crowd at the square right now—public trials like this don't happen every day!","source_cn":"干嘛来找我？现在这时间，你们该去广场上凑凑热闹。公审罪...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6214827B5ADCACB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1224407003:1":{"text":"Your tone tells me you won't be coming with us.","source_cn":"听你的语气，不打算和我们一起去吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x645ACF2A3DFF2E58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1224407004:1":{"text":"...I didn't say that.","source_cn":"……我没说这话。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26C1DF98A4D42AFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1224407005:1":{"text":"You didn't say it aloud, but that's what you meant.","source_cn":"你是没这么说，但你就是这个意思。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB261C6E64E107BCE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1224407006:1":{"text":"When the villagers said you were scared to face the trial, I didn't believe them, but now I'm convinced.","source_cn":"村里人说你不敢面对接下来会发生的事，本来我还不相信，现...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C196648BD35522A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1224407007:1":{"text":"But I'm puzzled. What could the fearless Sinbad be worrying about?","source_cn":"但漫漫想不通。天不怕地不怕的辛巴达，究竟在逃避什么呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03C31C4AF2FB65AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1224407007":{"text":"But I'm puzzled. What could the fearless Sinbad be worrying about?","source_cn":"但漫漫想不通。天不怕地不怕的辛巴达，究竟在逃避什么呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03C31C4AF2FB65AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1224407008:1":{"text":"I trust Sonja to be impartial, so the trial is in safe hands.","source_cn":"我相信索尼娅会公正处理这件事。所以我不担心公审结果，一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A51FCE15946347C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1224407010:1":{"text":"...Anyway, please stop with the 